{
  "id": "p40",
  "title": "The Pub, the Pitch, and the Old Commander",
  "titleZh": "酒馆、球场与老司令",
  "topic": "偏远村庄酒馆与板球队",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The remote village keeps one small pub and a cricket field.",
        "zh": "这个偏远的村庄保留着一家小酒馆和一块板球场。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A retired commander rents the pub for a modest monthly sum.",
        "zh": "一位退役司令以不多的月租租下这家酒馆。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His beer is cheap, and a warm pot of soup costs little.",
        "zh": "他的啤酒很便宜，一锅热汤也花不了多少钱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A slice of bread is free, and the small bill is due.",
        "zh": "一片面包是免费的，而那笔小账单到期了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A range of old instruments hangs above the wooden rail.",
        "zh": "一排旧乐器挂在木栏杆上方。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My uncle plays an occasional tune to entertain the guests.",
        "zh": "我叔叔偶尔弹一支曲子来娱乐客人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young reader studies the definition of every local rule.",
        "zh": "一位年轻读者研究每一条本地规则的定义。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The club needs new players, and the association will ensure fair play.",
        "zh": "俱乐部需要新球员，而协会将确保公平比赛。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They elect a captain, but one small faction disputes the result.",
        "zh": "他们选出一位队长，但一个小派系对结果提出异议。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The minority group accepts defeat and merely asks for a rematch.",
        "zh": "少数一方接受失败，只是要求再赛一场。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A satellite dish likely brings matches from a distant city.",
        "zh": "一口卫星天线很可能把小城的比赛带到这里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The atmosphere in the pub is warm and rather unusual.",
        "zh": "酒馆里的气氛温暖，而且相当不同寻常。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Few civilians here recognize the old man at the corner.",
        "zh": "这里很少有平民认出角落里的那位老人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His quiet profile belongs to a man who once led troops.",
        "zh": "他安静的侧影属于一个曾经带过兵的人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He keeps a firm balance between duty and a sense of liberty.",
        "zh": "他在责任与自由感之间保持着稳固的平衡。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sudden burst of rain sends an urgent call for cover.",
        "zh": "一阵突然的雨引来紧急的避雨呼喊。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They handle the leak by simple means and a steady hand.",
        "zh": "他们用简单的方法和一只稳手处理漏水。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They replace one broken element in the club's long plan.",
        "zh": "他们更换了俱乐部长期计划中一个损坏的元件。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then, given the circumstance, they await a clearer date.",
        "zh": "然后，鉴于这种情况，他们等待一个更清楚的日期。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later a manufacturer offers bats with the committee's approval.",
        "zh": "后来一位制造商在委员会的批准下提供了球拍。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A weekend session teaches the youngest players how to qualify.",
        "zh": "一次周末课程教最年轻的球员如何取得资格。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the season, their coach hopes to keep going to the fifteenth round.",
        "zh": "赛季期间，他们的教练希望一路打进第十五轮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A local paper alleges a charge of theft and a missing sum.",
        "zh": "一份本地报纸声称有一项盗窃指控和一笔失踪的款项。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt denies it and shows an ideal withdrawal record.",
        "zh": "我姑姑否认此事，并出示了一份理想的取款记录。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An abandoned shed becomes a store and gives two men employment.",
        "zh": "一间废弃的棚屋成了仓库，并给两个人提供了工作。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My father's stories of hell never bore the young players.",
        "zh": "我父亲关于地狱的故事从不使年轻球员厌烦。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They liberate the club from debt, though one old friend chose suicide.",
        "zh": "他们把俱乐部从债务中解放出来，尽管一位老朋友选择了自杀。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later a brief pause follows, and the old couple quietly divorce.",
        "zh": "随后是一段短暂的停顿，那对老夫妇平静地离婚了。"
      }
    ]
  ],
